License: GPL-2.0-or-later; original source headers and LICENSE retained.
Only the selected engine and its compiled header closure are vendored. Alternate
platform backends, build files, audio backends and network transports are omitted.
The platform adapter is apps/doom/main.cpp. No game data is included.

Local patches:
- m_config.c: enable real configuration load/save; use ./; atomically replace
  checked configuration writes; retain upstream per-IWAD save directory layout.
- g_game.c: check save fclose and rename; do not unlink the previous save first.
- i_system.c/h: const format contract; ordinary exit; remove host desktop dialogs.
- doomkeys.h, m_controls.c, i_input.c: use canonical Doom keys so DOS scan-code
  configuration round-trips; default fire to J for hosts reserving Ctrl; remove
  an always-true comparison on unsigned key codes.
- p_maputl.c: make the legacy DOS pointer-to-int emulation truncation explicit on LP64.
